templates/settings/settings.user.json:38:      "_model_comment": "PLAN-163 T1.1 / FXe (ADR-181 Contingency). Advisory session-default pin so a fresh `install --ceremony user` does NOT inherit the CC 2.1.220 sonnet-5 tier-default (the silent-flip that settings.base.json closes for the maintainer path). This is the MINIMUM pin for the advisory profile: it deliberately OMITS availableModels + enforceAvailableModels so the user path stays non-enforcing (advisory-only) by design. Do NOT add availableModels/enforceAvailableModels here — that would change the profile's advisory nature."
