   841	               git_budget_s: float = GIT_BUDGET_S) -> Tuple[Dict[str, Any], Dict[str, Any]]:
   842	    """PreToolUse: guard a resume, record the launch (manifest + snapshot + index line), then
   843	    enrich the code revision within budget. Returns (decision, manifest).
